>> title: Olive Oil Cake
>> category: Cakes & Loaves
>> tags: olive oil, orange, dessert, oven
>> servings: 8
>> time: 1 hr

Grease a #9-in round cake pan{} and line the bottom with parchment.

Preheat the #oven{} to 350°F (175°C).

Whisk @extra-virgin olive oil{3/4%cup}(180 mL; fruity, not bitter), @granulated sugar{1%cup}(200 g), @eggs{3%large}, @orange zest{1%Tbs}(from 1 orange).

Whisk @whole milk{3/4%cup}(180 mL), @orange juice{1/4%cup}(60 mL) into @&(~1)oil mixture{}.

Whisk @all-purpose flour{1 3/4%cup}(220 g), @baking powder{2%tsp}(8 g), @table salt{3/4%tsp}(4 g).

Fold @&(~1)dry mixture{} into @&(4)wet mixture{}.

Bake @&(~1)batter{} at 350°F for ~{50%min}.
